NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

This MIT license covers the source code in this repository only.

MercuryRec builds on the Retailrocket ecommerce dataset, which is licensed
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike). That dataset is NOT
redistributed here: the repository ships a download script that fetches it
from Kaggle at build time, and both raw and derived data artifacts are
excluded from version control.

Anyone using this repository with the Retailrocket data is bound by the
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms for that data and any artifacts derived from it,
including the NonCommercial and ShareAlike conditions. See docs/data-card.md.
